    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are exceptionally proud to present this stunning two-bedroom first-floor apartment to the Dublin 8 property market. Positioned securely within the highly popular and prestigious Southgate development on Cork Street, Apt 7 offers an incredible opportunity for buyers seeking a spacious, high-spec home on the doorstep of the city centre.\nThe location is truly unbeatable. Situated on Cork Street, Southgate sits in the heart of historic Dublin 8, putting you within comfortable walking distance of St. Stephen's Green, Grafton Street, Weaver Park, and the vibrant Liberties district. The area is renowned for its eclectic mix of trendy artisan cafes, fine dining spots, local bars, and essential conveniences. Public transport links are exceptional, with major bus corridors stopping right outside your front door and the Luas lines easily accessible, linking you effortlessly across the capital.\nSpanning a massive c. 90 sqm, Apt 7 comes to the market in exquisite, turn-key condition throughout. Boasting a highly desirable BER B rating and an array of premium finishes from high-end interior-designed bathrooms to a sunny south-facing balcony with views of the Dublin Mountains, this home offers a luxurious city living experience. The apartment is flooded with loads of natural light through generous windows in the kitchen, living area, and bedrooms. Quality wood flooring and crown moulding flows seamlessly throughout the main living spaces and two spacious double bedrooms, both equipped with quality built-in wardrobes. A standout feature is the massive master bedroom, complete with a luxurious private ensuite boasting a walk-in shower, modern LED mirrors, and striking royal blue tiling. The sleek main bathroom also features beautiful glossy porcelain tiles. The generous living room opens out onto the private south-facing balcony, catching optimal sunlight throughout the day. The home includes a secure designated car space. \nViewing is highly advised. Call RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today for further information or to arrange a viewing!\n\nAdditional Features;\n•c. 90 sqm\n•BER B\n•2 BED / 2 BATH\n•Management fees: c. 2,143 per annum\n•First floor position\n•Stunning interior-designed bathrooms with glossy porcelain tiles\n•Private south-facing balcony \n•Designated car space included\n•Quality wood flooring fitted throughout\n•Excellent natural light\n•Large open-plan lounge/dining & fully fitted kitchen area\n•Two generous double bedrooms with fitted storage\n•Master bedroom complete with ensuite\n•Short walk to St. Stephen's Green, Weaver Park & Grafton Street\n•Excellent public transport options in walking distance including the red luas line\n•Ideal for First-Time Buyers, Professionals, and Investors\nDirections\nTraveling outbound from Dublin City Centre along Patrick Street, take the right-hand turn onto Dean Street and proceed onto Luke Street. Continue straight onto Cork Street. Pass Weaver Park on your right-hand side, and the secure entrance to Southgate will be located on your left, \n"
      },
      {
